on appears in the upper-right corner. The Liquid Glass background of the button is yellow, and its label, which shows a checkmark, is white. The shade of yellow is vibrant.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/033f3f6540cc36385bc5993e2152895b/color-context-light-mode%402x.png","line":21,"embedded":true},{"title":"A screenshot of the Notes app in iOS with the light system appearance and increased contrast. The Notes app is open to a note with the text 'Note'. The text is selected, which shows a yellow selection highlight and text editing menu. The Done button appears in the upper-right corner. The Liquid Glass background of the button is yellow, and its label, which shows a checkmark, is black. The shade of yellow is darker to provide more contrast and differentiation against the note's white background.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/9fa4e239f30421b0f00ee77dcace0c14/color-context-light-mode-high-contrast%402x.png","line":25,"embedded":true},{"title":"A screenshot of the Notes app in iOS with the dark system appearance and default contrast. The Notes app is open to a note with the text 'Note'. The text is selected, which shows a yellow selection highlight and text editing menu. The Done button appears in the upper-right corner. The Liquid Glass background of the button is yellow, and its label, which shows a checkmark, is white.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/dc3523da3cba1dd53d3501c763335e6c/color-context-dark-mode%402x.png","line":29,"embedded":true},{"title":"A screenshot of the Notes app in iOS with the dark system appearance and increased contrast. The Notes app is open to a note with the text 'Note'. The text is selected, which shows a yellow selection highlight and text editing menu. The Done button appears in the upper-right corner. The Liquid Glass background of the button is yellow, and its label, which shows a checkmark, is black.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/95af2bc7dece914a5f870f38edac2998/color-context-dark-mode-high-contrast%402x.png","line":33,"embedded":true},{"title":"Color management","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/color#Color-management","line":39},{"title":"`UIWhitePointAdaptivityStyle`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/BundleResources/Information-Property-List/UIWhitePointAdaptivityStyle","line":39},{"title":"`ColorPicker`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SwiftUI/ColorPicker","line":43},{"title":"Inclusive color","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/color#Inclusive-color","line":45},{"title":"Accessibility","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/accessibility","line":49},{"title":"An illustration of an upward-trending stock chart in the Stocks app in English. The line of the graph is green to indicate the rising value of the stock during the selected time period.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/5969ae10a6eaca6879fb43df4f651e4d/color-inclusive-color-charts-english%402x.png","line":53,"embedded":true},{"title":"An illustration of an upward-trending stock chart in the Stocks app in Chinese. The line of the graph is red to indicate the rising value of the stock during the selected time period.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/e84b6e7089f1fb8f73712da462d66164/color-inclusive-color-charts-chinese%402x.png","line":55,"embedded":true},{"title":"System colors","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/color#System-colors","line":57},{"title":"`Color`","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/SwiftUI/Color","line":59},{"title":"secondary text label","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/uikit/uicolor/secondarylabel","line":63},{"title":"separator","target":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/uikit/uicolor/separator","line":63},{"title":"Liquid Glass color","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/color#Liquid-Glass-color","line":65},{"title":"Liquid Glass","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/materials#Liquid-Glass","line":67},{"title":"A screenshot of the Done button in iOS, which appears as a checkmark on a blue Liquid Glass background.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/df4d0a0bca32edb16d7ff86e34d6fe2d/color-liquid-glass-overview-tinted%402x.png","line":69,"embedded":true},{"title":"A screenshot of a tab bar in iOS, with the first tab selected. The symbol and text label of the selected tab bar item are blue.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/5a9078b2ea4baec1f15773638c9377c6/color-liquid-glass-overview-color-over-tab-bar%402x.png","line":71,"embedded":true},{"title":"A screenshot of the Share button in iOS over a colorful image. The colors from the background image infuse the Liquid Glass in the button, affecting its color.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/9cf610d972c97dee46b9e206525b2ae7/color-liquid-glass-overview-clear%402x.png","line":73,"embedded":true},{"title":"A screenshot of the top half of an iPhone app that shows a toolbar with several buttons. All of the buttons in the toolbar use a blue accent color for their Liquid Glass background.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/9b7b9adb67ee5f70839540534fdeb374/colors-liquid-glass-usage-incorrect%402x.png","line":79,"embedded":true},{"title":"An X in a circle to indicate incorrect usage.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/209f6f0fc8ad99d9bf59e12d82d06584/crossout%402x.png","line":81,"embedded":true},{"title":"A screenshot of the top half of an iPhone app that shows a toolbar with several buttons. Only the Done button in the toolbar uses a blue accent color for its Liquid Glass background.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/3897